w concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)3000_900.png", "id": "429007318575366", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_429007321908699_4258283118475983943_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qx4HXki6w0YQ7kNvwEkHMz8&_nc_oc=Adnn8Zq4aJQwdsOlGda0-DRpULsqIVrPSZOHANiQ9CIha71RLNb2tWfv240rsf4HyVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyellRHwK38pBHjOMkI2TZ9pDtxgGlw_xBFLtB6rYXYwg&oe=69AD642A"}, {"file_name": "\ub354\ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub85c\uace0(\ud55c\uae00).png", "id": "3213236945564295", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_3213236948897628_4786406447797518072_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yL9JE1Z8vr4Q7kNvwGTK5Zj&_nc_oc=AdmBDjPcIttnfQ7c4SV69Ccs8D-htx13Q4CcZugoKqzYaJhWGCYR2RZQknni3YyIUtI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwygzgKzsMfxY95N6U-DiXQ8SfT9UhTAPx9OWS8_0SAhQ&oe=69AD76DE"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)2560_1440.png", "id": "1042171706627527", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429288_1042171713294193_695814847444454466_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UvPmt1M6S8IQ7kNvwHSO20f&_nc_oc=AdkelNkR6KNLiwp0P6kXPkwbyIRRCpIpPYH3Y7_W0YdvUbaE04mRkVNGQC_D_If9QMk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwiPF7SvoTpGjolVT44ve-ycKYqBCVpoiWAt6NPjTbHLg&oe=69AD65B1"}, {"file_name": "(\ub370\ubaa8)(\ud55c\uae00)1080_360.png", "id": "9